    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers is delighted to present this stunning one-bedroom open-plan apartment to the market. Ideally located in the highly sought-after area of Smithfield. This charming property features an open plan layout, as you enter the property into a large and light fitted modern kitchen cum lounge area. Off this room is a double bedroom fitted with wardrobes and carpet flooring. There is also a main bathroom. This property is ideally suited to modern living and is located within a ten-minute walk of Dublin city center. The development is within easy walking distance of the Four Courts and the wider city center, and is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the Smithfield LUAS stop located adjacent to the development. Phoenix Park is also close by, providing extensive outdoor recreational space. \r\n\r\nTo register your interest, please contact Shauna O’Brien at BROE auctioneers today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Lounge \t\t\t4.60m x 3.45m \tBright lounge area to include wood flooring and large bay window. \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t3.06m x 3.46m\tHigh gloss kitchen to include all appliance’s and tiled flooring.  \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\t\t4.62m x 2.91m \tStunning double bedroom to included built in wardrobes and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t\t\t\tMain bathroom to include W.H.B, W.C and bath.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
